#, c-format
msgid "This is an installation prompt for connecting this OpenCode setup to White Noise through Marmot. Read the latest connector guide at https://github.com/marmot-protocol/mdk/blob/master/crates/agent-connector/README.md. Explain to me how the connector works and what the installation will change. Then propose the installation steps for my public npub: %s, and ask for my approval before making any changes. Once I approve, install and verify the connector, then reply with your agent npub."
